    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Solomon /ameenár xoordaá hatlá' gari sla'atír áy. Dasír Farao gana duúx, nee /ameenár múk Moabu, nee ar múk Amoni nee ar múk Edomu, nee ar múk Sidoni nee ar múk Hiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós /ameenaarí gana duxuút tam AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aa ooi, «Kuungá' múk Israeli nee xoorduká' miti duxuutara', asma /ameenaarí munerhúng ga hhitiín, gari warqés amór mungui.» Ala Solomon /ameenaarí gana ló'wa slaá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tlaawoó Solomon tay tsiire faanqw, nee /ameenár quturmo wasl a tsiire tám. /Ameenaarí guri muuná warqés loohír Mungú ngiwa may. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár iwa dín, /ameenaarós tidá' guri hhitiín, munguaá hatlá giri sagadiyuús, tam muunaáwós iri inkihhimu wasleés dír AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúwose, adoodár baabuúwós Daudi gaa eehariiká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomon munguú ta bay Ashtaroti kuduú /ameeni oo múk Sidoni guna sagadiyuús, nee Milkomu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11:5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Milkomu:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Umuuwí a umuú munguú múk Amoni.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kudá' ta waki oo múk Amoni guri eehár ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe, Solomon tlakweema giri tleéhh geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGUHE, inós Mungú gwa ilaiwa/iiká adoodá' baabuúwós Daudi aa tleéhh, laqaá tidá' Mungú i slai gaa eehariiká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá tloomadár bihhaá da/aáw awa Yerusalemu, Solomon kiteeri giri tleéhh awa ilahhooa kawa hanmiisi dír munguúdá' ta waki oo ta bay Kemoshi oo múk Moabu nee dír munguúdá' ta waki oo ta bay Moloki",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11:7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Moloki:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Umuuwí oo munguú múk Amoni sleeme.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " oo múk Amoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós sleeme /ameenaarós tidá' gari diírií tleéhh ar mooyangwdá' tsuú' kuwa da/aa/an, nee dír munguii'ín ngiwa ilahhooár muruú ta tsú/í hanmiisiya'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguú múk Israeli, Solomon guri i buúhh, asma inós AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguú múk Israeli gwaa geexáy, handá' tam AAKOÓ MUNGÚ taa sagaáwa tsár wa doogii'i, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee guri báy, «Munguaá hatlá' mi haratlintatiaar.» Ala Solomon hara'ayár AAKOÓ MUNGÚ gaa iialooeesiiká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Solomon guri báy, «Asma kuúng alqador'eé' kawa otká nee kaahir'eé' tidá' ugwa bawi, ar looeemaawo, aníng waawuti'iimar'eé' a /uútl, ngiri haniís dír sagadiyusmoowók. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tam adoorihe as baabuúwók Daudi tí a tleehhaaká baraá hotaawoge, ala waawuti'iimarí a hingeés baraá dabaá garmaawoge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tam dír garmaawoge waawuti'iima hingeesaro a faakaaká, ala garmaawók u tlahhoó wák i geexáw as sagadiyusmooeé' Daudi, nee as gixsar'eé' ar Yerusalemu, tidá' aníng naa tsawaár.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Hadadi kuduú tlahhoó waawutmoó Edomu guri wakarusmoó Solomon tleéhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aáng qoomár Daudi múk Edomu nguwa baál Yoabu, geeraharusmoó úr oo slaqwaruusér Daudi, ina tláy yaamaá Edomu as muk'ín kudá' taa tsuú/ nguwa fooli. Yoabu hhawaate sleémeero awa Edomu gina tsuú/. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoabu nee slaqwaruusér Israeli sleémeero tana hoót amoodá' wa ale har afiqoomoó slahheeri lahhoó', as hhawaataá Edomu sleémeero ngiwa tsu/i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala Hadadi, qoomaadae a garmoó niiná, iri /akuút ay yaamaá Misri dinkwa nee sagadiyuusér doó baabuúwós tidár múk Edomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hadadi nee mukós tari tláy yaamaá Midianír wa ale, dír Paraniro mukko kuri didá wa artláy, tari alkoné' ay dír waawutmoó yaamaá Misri. Waawutmo Farao Hadadi guri muruú /aymaárií haniís nee do' nee yaamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Farao Hadadi guri ló'wa slaá'. Gawaá adoorihe guri duuxutís ar hho'ór hareerós. Umuú harér Farao a waawuto'o Tapenesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hho'ór Tapenesi Hadadi guri garmií xwayluúr kuri báy Genubati. Tapenesi harér Farao Genubati guri umiín. Tari al uraaráy dinkwa nee na/aá doó waawutmo Farao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala Hadadi ngiwa axaás adór Daudi nee Yoabu geeraharusmoó slaqwaruuseerós nira qatliyé', waawutmo Farao guri báy, «Gám aníng pa/ángwií haniisáng oo niwa waatl ayaaeéní ale.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala Farao iri oó', «Gaa a milá ar naa /itiím, kuúng tawa ki/imaá sla' baraá ayaawók?»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hadadi Farao guri ló'wa firín, iwa kaahi, «Gár án ni slaa' a tí kilós, in geemeér niwa tlaw.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slám male alé Mungú Resoni garmoó Eliada guri wakarusmoó Solomon tleéhh. Resoni aáng nina dír aakoowós Hadadeseri wa /akuút, waawutmoó Soba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alaá Daudi múk Soba nguwa tsuú/, Resoni malguuse gana burumbuúr, inós nguri geeraharusmooín wa qaasiyé'. Naagáy Resoni nee mukós tari tláy ay Damasko, tari amoodá' wa hoót, Resoni kuri waawutmoó Damasko wa qaás. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Resoni a wakarusmoó múk Israeli qooma sleémeero ar waawuti'iimár Solomonuwo. Inós Solomon guri ló'wa daawitamiís adoodá' kura daawitimiís nee Hadadi. Naagáy Resoni múk Israeli guna ló'wa aáhh qoomaadá' inós tawa waawutmo yaamaá Aramu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeroboamu garmoó Nebati, heé tlahhoó Efraimu oo yaamaá Sereda, inós a sagadiyusmoó waawutmo Solomon. Aayoorós a kwaalo'o, tidá' ta bay Serua. Yeroboamu sleeme ina dee/anuút dír waawutmoowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gár isa dee/anuút a tí:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár Solomon iwa didár Miló alqoomeemesi, nee iwa koo/ír gawdeemisi ar gixsár Daudi baabuúwós, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "qoomaadae Yeroboamu a garmoó aleesleemuú koóm, nee oo ilakaahara. Naagáy Solomon adoorí ngiwa ár adór Yeroboamu kur ilakahaár gadiyeede, guri sagesihhtusmoó gadiyér gawít wa qaás ar tawa noongo'otiiká, tidá' ta tlehhiiti nee múk tlahhoó Yosefu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Looarka wake Yeroboamu iwa aa'aá kay amór Yerusalemu, aarusmo Ahiya oo Shilo tari doogiyé' nee inós baraá loohi. Ahiya tlawuú /abén ngwaa tsiít. Inooín tsaraawo ta baraá xatsa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aarusmo Ahiya tlawuuwós kudá' guri adaá duúx, guri feehhamiís warqeemo mibaá nee tsár. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeroboamu guri báy, «Warqamaawók awa mibaangw ooheek, asma AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguú múk Israeli i kaahi, ‹Qaytsiít, aníng waawuti'iima a qasiís gawaá dabaá Solomonuwo, aníng tlahh'aá mibaangw ngi kuúng i haniís.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala inós u tlahhoó wák i geexáw as sagadiyusmooeé' Daudi, nee as gixsar'eé' ar Yerusalemu, tidá' naa tsawaár baraá tlahh'i sleémeero awa Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng adoorí a tleéhh asma Solomon aníng iwa geexáy, munguaá hatlá' gina sluufmisuú áy, kudá' ta bay Ashtaroti, munguú /ameeni kuduú múk Sidoni, nee Kemoshi, munguú múk Moabu, nee Milkomu, munguú múk Amoni. Solomon aa dee/aanuút, tlakweema gaa tleéhh dír geeraaeene, nee kaahir'eé' gaa oohiiká nee axweesante'eene. Adoodá' baabuúwós Daudi aa tleéhh inós gaa eehariiká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tam adoorihe aníng waawuti'iima a hayohaaká gawaá dabaawose, ala án ugwa waawutmoó wa qaás baraá hotaawós sleémeero as Daudi, sagadiyusmooeé' kudá' naa tsawaár, kudá' hara'ayar'eé' gaa oh nee kaahir'eene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala waawuti'iima a hayóh gawaá dabaá garmaawose, tlahh'aá mibaangw ngiri kuúngií haniís. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Garmaawós kwí Solomon, aníng u tlahhoó wák i haniís, asma qooma sleémeero xwaylár sagadiyusmooeé' Daudi tlahhaywí nguwa sawaawuti'iin baraakaá Yerusalemúr wa alé, nee inós masók a gwa/aateema baraá gixsár Yerusalemu ar aníng naa tsawaár as tawa dír aníng tiwa sluufmiisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gimáy, daxta kuúng Yeroboamu, aníng kuúng u waawutmoó Israeli wa qaás, daqaní kuúng ki sawaawuti'iín ar adoodá' ta sla'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuúng tidá' aníng naa oó' bara harmagáhh nee bara hót ar adoodá' aníng ni slaa', nee tidá' aníng ni slaa' bara tléhh, nee kaahir'eé' bara ót nee hara'ayar'eene, ar adoodá' sagadiyusmooeé' Daudi aa tleéhh, daqaní aníng nee kuúng a dinkwa. Aníng waawuti'iimarók a gawdeés adór ar Daudi ngira gawdeés nee múk Israeli ngu kuúngií haniís. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As tlakweemaá Solomon aníng xwaylár Daudi a muúx, ala a daqisleemeeká.› »",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Gawaá adoorihe, Solomon Yeroboamu guri gaasár wa slaá', ala Yeroboamu iri /akuút ay yaamaá Misri awa waawutmo Shishaki, iri hoót Misrír wa alé ay qoomár Solomon iwa gwaá'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tlehhma'aá Solomon sleémeero nee sagalooarose kaa gooín baraá kitaábuú tlehhma'aá Solomon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomon waawuti'iima ngaa /aáy kureeri mibeeri tsiyáhh baraá yaamaá Israeliwo, nee gixsarós ar ur a Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo Solomon iri gwaá', kuri foól baraá gixsár baabuúwós Daudi. Garmaawós Rehoboamu iri waawuti'ín kitaangós wa ale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
